1. **Enable Analytics in Vercel Dashboard**: Navigate to your project's Analytics section and click "Enable" if not already done
2. **Deploy to Vercel**: Run `vercel deploy` to push the changes (though no code changes were needed)
3. **Verify**: After deployment, check browser's Network tab for requests to `/<unique-path>/view` when visiting pages

